<section class="sub" id="glance">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="section-num">01 · AT A GLANCE</div>
<h2 class="section-title">How each reform is holding up</h2>
<p class="section-note">A quick-reference index before the detail below. "Durable" means adopted and standing as of August 2026; "Contested" means litigation, rollback, or an active repeal fight; "In progress" means the code rewrite hasn't finished.</p>
</div>
<div class="table-scroll">
