<tr><td class="city"><a class="cell-link" href="#pcs-portland">Portland, OR</a><span class="place">flagship</span></td><td>RIP / RIP2 — up to 4–6 units, cottage clusters</td><td class="year">2021–22</td><td><span class="pill durable">Durable</span></td></tr>
