<tr><td class="city"><a class="cell-link" href="#pcs-boulder">Boulder, CO</a><span class="place">peer</span></td><td>ADU expansion + state-driven duplex allowance</td><td class="year">2024–</td><td><span class="pill emerging">In progress</span></td></tr>
